{"id":"li_nea","lemma":"línea","pos":"noun","rank":557,"glosses":["line (a straight path through two or more points)","line (a piece of spoken dialogue in a script)","line (a path for electrical current)"],"ipa":"/ˈlinea/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"líneas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-l%C3%ADnea.wav","examples":[{"text":"La línea está ocupada.","en":"The line is busy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444306"},{"text":"Lee entre las líneas.","en":"Read between the lines.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38823"},{"text":"¡Formen una línea recta!","en":"Form a straight line!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/702889"},{"text":"Deja un espacio entre las líneas.","en":"Leave a space between the lines.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645322"},{"text":"Firma sobre esta línea.","en":"Sign above this line.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/633205"}]}